"""29 October 2026 : ZenRay Meshes RETOPOLOGY CAR, every skin component of the clean partition finished the same way, borders shared.
For each component : its loop of shared arcs (ZrrNet), four corners (nodes first, then the sharpest turns), four sides made of arc pieces ;
the number of quads of every arc piece is solved ONCE for the whole car (opposite sides of every component equal), so two neighbours
sample a shared piece with the same points : welded by construction. The grid is the inverse of a HARMONIC map of the component onto the
unit square (Rado Kneser Choquet : the harmonic extension of a border homeomorphism onto a convex domain is a diffeomorphism, so even a
concave component, a fender around its arch, gets a grid without fold ; discrete five point Laplacian = convex combinations, Floater 2003).
Heights come from the fair field of the component (validated shape, thin plate, borders held on the shared arcs). Borders of separate
panels (doors, hood, decklid, glass, bumper) are pulled in by half the gap ; the panel is closed with its rolled edge (ZrrPatch.panel).
python ZrrCar.py [names...]      default : the skin components of the left side and of the centre ; the right side is their mirror
FR : toute la caisse composant par composant, bords partagés soudés par construction, grille sans pli par application harmonique."""
